OL,3,ABlade Runner 2099 not just about AI,   
OL,4,Asay star Hunter Schafer and series     
OL,5,Acreator                                
OL,7,F"What does it mean to be human?" is a  
OL,8,Fquestion that's always been at the     
OL,9,Fheart of Blade Runner.                 
OL,11,FThe first film in the series, released 
OL,12,Fin 1982, depicted a technologically    
OL,13,Fadvanced yet dystopian version of Los  
OL,14,FAngeles in the then-distant future of  
OL,15,F2019.                                  
OL,17,FWhile the movie's flying cars haven't -
OL,18,Fquite - materialised yet in the real   
OL,19,Fworld, Blade Runner's themes of        
OL,20,Ftechnological progress and the threats 
OL,21,Fit poses feel just as relevant.        
